    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "If the Court decides not to grant the application, the company must, within 14 days beginning on the date on which the decision is made or on which the proceedings are discontinued for any reasons -- (a) give notice of the decision to the auditor ...; and (b) send a copy of the written statement to every member of the company and to that auditor" (a duty met in time, or not yet due: the provision's own question; fork line F-D1)

@ref s 205AD(4) (src:19435-19444)
